      "title": "VT-4 MIDI Implementation Chart (version 1.02, Nov. 16. 2018)",
      "notes": "Control Change list read by tools/profiles/roland/read-cc-list.mjs from VT-4_MIDI_Imple_eng02_W.pdf, page 7 (sha256 fa3cdf876b24ddaf7af28abbe4cb8d64acb3f9bee613b25cff8d42521ae21a78), https://static.roland.com/assets/media/pdf/VT-4_MIDI_Imple_eng02_W.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/roland/make-cc-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/roland/cc-synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a controller the manual lists, on the number it gives, with the name it prints. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Roland prints no value ranges for these controllers, so each is 0 - 127 on the wire unless a note below says the manual prints otherwise; a switch is a number until the instrument shows where its positions fall.",
    "Program Change 0 - 8 recalls MANUAL and Scenes 1 - 8 (chart, Program Change remarks); the VT-4 itself sends 0 - 4."
  ],
